# A simple smart home alarm system.
# Written in plain English. No programming knowledge required.

make a neuron named siren with threshold 10 and leak 0
make a synapse named motion_detector with trace 10
make a synapse named door_sensor with trace 10

# External physical sensors put energy into the system
put physical_motion into the input of motion_detector
put physical_door into the input of door_sensor

# FIX: We cannot flow two things into the same input. 
# We must combine them first to avoid a physical short circuit.
combine the update from motion_detector and door_sensor into the input of siren

start the system
